flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[User enters word list]
    B --> C[Validate input]

    C -->|Invalid| D[Show error]
    D --> B

    C -->|Valid| E[Store original words]
    E --> F[Initialize state]
    F --> G[Display candidate words]

    G --> H{More than one word remaining?}

    H -->|No| I[Display solution]
    I --> J[End]

    H -->|Yes| K[User selects guess]
    K --> L[User enters match count]

    L --> M[Add to history]
    M --> N[Recalculate using constraints]

    N --> O[Update filtered words]
    O --> P[Render updated UI]

    P --> G